       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "reviewBody": "Wow! Definitely a keeper! I used chicken tenders and added paprika to the flour. I was really low on breadcrumbs and ended up mixing some crushed plain potato chips with breadcrumbs. I'm new to airfryer cooking and I'm amazed at how good food tastes when cooked or even reheated in them. This will be my new go to chicken recipe- next time I'll try w/ just breadcrumbs .",
